```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as "Client (Web UI / API Consumer)"
    participant Controller as "API: VehiclesController"
    participant Binding as "Model Binding & Validation"
    participant DTOs as "API Contracts (DTOs)"
    participant App as "Application Layer (Commands / Queries / Handlers)"
    participant Domain as "Domain Model / Vehicle Entity"
    participant Repo as "Repositories / VehicleRepository"
    participant DbContext as "ONE_Classics_DbContext (EF Core)"
    participant MySQL as "MySQL Production Database"
    participant External as "External Services (Auth, Storage, Search)"

    %% Create (POST) flow
    Client->>Controller: POST /api/vehicles (CreateVehicleRequest)
    Controller->>Binding: Bind & validate DTO
    Binding-->>Controller: Validated DTO
    Controller->>App: CreateVehicleCommand
    App->>Domain: Construct Vehicle entity / validate domain rules
    App->>Repo: AddAsync(vehicle)
    Repo->>DbContext: DbContext.Vehicles.Add(entity) / SaveChangesAsync()
    DbContext->>MySQL: INSERT INTO vehicles (...)
    MySQL-->>DbContext: Persisted row (vehicle_id)
    DbContext-->>Repo: Entity with vehicle_id
    Repo-->>App: Persisted Vehicle
    App-->>Controller: VehicleResponse DTO
    Controller-->>Client: 201 Created + VehicleResponse

    %% Read (GET) flow
    Client->>Controller: GET /api/vehicles/{id}
    Controller->>App: GetVehicleByIdQuery
    App->>Repo: GetByIdAsync(id)
    Repo->>DbContext: FindAsync(id)
    DbContext->>MySQL: SELECT FROM vehicles WHERE vehicle_id = ...
    MySQL-->>DbContext: Row
    DbContext-->>Repo: Entity
    Repo-->>App: Vehicle entity
    App-->>Controller: VehicleResponse DTO
    Controller-->>Client: 200 OK + VehicleResponse

    %% Update (PUT) flow
    Client->>Controller: PUT /api/vehicles/{id} (UpdateVehicleRequest)
    Controller->>Binding: Bind & validate DTO
    Binding-->>Controller: Validated DTO
    Controller->>App: UpdateVehicleCommand
    App->>Repo: GetByIdAsync(id)
    Repo->>DbContext: FindAsync(id)
    DbContext->>MySQL: SELECT ...
    MySQL-->>DbContext: Row
    DbContext-->>Repo: Entity
    App->>Domain: Apply updates to entity / enforce invariants
    App->>Repo: Update(entity) / SaveChangesAsync()
    DbContext->>MySQL: UPDATE vehicles SET ...
    MySQL-->>DbContext: Updated row
    DbContext-->>Repo: Updated entity
    Repo-->>App: Updated Vehicle
    App-->>Controller: VehicleResponse / NoContent
    Controller-->>Client: 200 OK / 204 No Content

    %% Error / Validation flow
    Binding-->>Controller: Validation errors
    Controller-->>Client: 400 Bad Request (ProblemDetails)

    %% External interactions
    App->>External: Call external services (Auth, Storage, Search) as needed
    External-->>App: Responses / tokens
```